---
title: Open Weather Application — State Machine Diagram (Weather Search)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Validating : submit query
    Idle --> RequestingPermission : click "Use my location"

    Validating --> InvalidInput : [query empty]
    Validating --> Geocoding : [query valid] / detect city or postal code
    InvalidInput --> Validating : resubmit

    state Geocoding {
        [*] --> CheckingCache
        CheckingCache --> CallingGeocodeAPI : cache miss
        CallingGeocodeAPI --> CachingResult : 200 OK
        CachingResult --> [*]
        CheckingCache --> [*] : cache hit
    }

    state matchCount <<choice>>
    Geocoding --> matchCount : results ready
    Geocoding --> SearchError : timeout / 429 / 401 / 5xx
    matchCount --> NoResults : [0 matches]
    matchCount --> AwaitingSelection : [more than 1 match]
    matchCount --> LoadingWeather : [exactly 1 match]

    AwaitingSelection --> LoadingWeather : user selects location
    NoResults --> Validating : submit new query

    RequestingPermission --> LocationUnavailable : denied / timeout (10 s) / unsupported / invalid coordinates
    RequestingPermission --> ReverseGeocoding : coordinates received
    ReverseGeocoding --> LoadingWeather : place name resolved
    ReverseGeocoding --> SearchError : API error
    LocationUnavailable --> Idle : dismiss message

    state fetchResult <<choice>>
    LoadingWeather --> fetchResult : fetch current + forecast
    fetchResult --> DisplayingWeather : [fresh or cached data]
    fetchResult --> DisplayingStale : [API error and stale cache exists]
    fetchResult --> SearchError : [API error and no cache]

    state DisplayingWeather {
        [*] --> Rendered
        Rendered --> Rendered : unit changed / redraw values and charts
        Rendered --> Saving : click "Save to favorites" [logged in]
        Saving --> Rendered : saved / duplicate / limit reached / error (message announced)
        Rendered --> Saving : click "Remove from favorites" [saved]
    }

    DisplayingStale --> LoadingWeather : retry
    DisplayingStale --> DisplayingWeather : fresh data received
    SearchError --> Idle : dismiss / retry

    DisplayingWeather --> Validating : submit new query
    DisplayingWeather --> RequestingPermission : click "Use my location"
    DisplayingWeather --> LoadingWeather : cache expired and page refreshed
    DisplayingWeather --> [*] : leave page

    note right of DisplayingWeather
        UV index shown only when the endpoint/plan
        provides it, otherwise "UV index unavailable"
    end note
